<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="light">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#f5faf7" />
    <title>AskPearls | Ask, explore, choose</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/app_css/app_page_index_concepts_shared_css.css?v=2" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/app_page_css/app_page_index_9_css.css?v=4" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/app_css/app_page_signin_info_modal_css.css" />
    <script src="~/app_page_js/app_page_index_js.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="concept-page concept-9">
        <header class="concept-header"><a class="concept-brand" href="/" aria-label="AskPearls home"><img src="/app_img/img_logo_color.png" alt="" /><span><strong>AskPearls</strong><small>Capture. Engage. Convert.</small></span></a><nav class="concept-actions" aria-label="Page options"><button class="concept-help" type="button" data-info-open="help"><span class="help-ring">?</span>Help</button><button class="concept-theme" id="theme-toggle" type="button" data-theme-toggle aria-label="Switch to dark theme" title="Switch theme"><svg class="icon-sun" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4" /><path d="M12 2v2m0 16v2M4.93 4.93l1.42 1.42m11.3 11.3 1.42 1.42M2 12h2m16 0h2M4.93 19.07l-1.42-1.42m11.3-11.3 1.42-1.42" /></svg><svg class="icon-moon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20.5 15.5A8.5 8.5 0 0 1 8.5 3.5 8.5 8.5 0 1 0 20.5 15.5Z" /></svg></button></nav></header>
        <main class="concept-main">
            <section class="concept-story" aria-labelledby="concept-title"><div class="concept-copy"><p class="concept-kicker">A CLEAR PATH FROM QUESTION TO ACTION</p><h1 id="concept-title">Ask. Explore.<br /><em>Choose with confidence.</em></h1><p class="concept-description">Turn your question into a clear path, with tailored options and thoughtful next steps.</p></div><div class="concept-art flow-art" role="img" aria-label="A visual flow from a question through explore, compare and recommendation steps"><div class="flow-question">What would you like to do?</div><div class="flow-arrows" aria-hidden="true">↙　↓　↘</div><div class="flow-choices"><div class="flow-choice"><span>⌕</span><b>Explore options</b><small>Learn something</small></div><div class="flow-choice"><span>☷</span><b>Compare choices</b><small>Solve a problem</small></div><div class="flow-choice"><span>✧</span><b>Get recommendations</b><small>Create something</small></div></div><div class="flow-down" aria-hidden="true"><span>↓</span><span>↓</span><span>↓</span></div><div class="flow-result"><div><b>Recommended</b><small>Best-fit ideas　● ●</small></div><div><b>Step-by-step guide</b><small>Your next actions　✓</small></div><div><b>Templates &amp; examples</b><small>Ready to explore　✦</small></div></div><p class="art-caption">Your question becomes a plan that fits you.</p></div></section>
            <section class="concept-auth" aria-labelledby="auth-title"><div class="concept-auth-card" id="google-auth-card" data-google-auth-url="/Home/GoogleLogin"><div class="concept-auth-mark"><img src="/app_img/img_logo_color.png" alt="" /></div><p class="concept-auth-kicker">SIGN IN TO ASKPEARLS</p><h2 id="auth-title">Explore your options<br />with confidence.</h2><p class="concept-auth-copy">Share your goals and let AskPearls help map a path to what’s possible.</p><button class="google-button" id="google-signin" type="button" data-google-signin><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="#FFC107" d="M43.6 24.5c0-1.6-.1-3.1-.4-4.5H24v8.5h11a9.4 9.4 0 0 1-4.1 6.2v5.2h6.7c3.9-3.6 6-8.9 6-15.4Z" /><path fill="#FF3D00" d="M24 44c5.5 0 10.1-1.8 13.5-4.9l-6.7-5.2c-1.8 1.2-4.1 2-6.8 2-5.2 0-9.7-3.5-11.3-8.2H5.8v5.4A20 20 0 0 0 24 44Z" /><path fill="#4CAF50" d="M12.7 27.7a12 12 0 0 1 0-7.4v-5.4H5.8a20 20 0 0 0 0 18.2l6.9-5.4Z" /><path fill="#1976D2" d="M24 12.1c3 0 5.6 1 7.7 3.1l5.8-5.8C34 6.1 29.4 4 24 4A20 20 0 0 0 5.8 14.9l6.9 5.4c1.6-4.7 6.1-8.2 11.3-8.2Z" /></svg><span>Continue with Google</span></button><p class="auth-message" id="auth-message" data-auth-message role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div class="concept-trust"><span class="trust-check">✓</span><span>No extra passwords. Your workspace is created automatically on your first sign-in.</span></div><p class="concept-legal">By continuing, you agree to our<br /><button type="button" data-info-open="terms">Terms of Service</button> and <button type="button" data-info-open="privacy">Privacy Policy</button>.</p></div></section>
        </main>
        <partial name="_SignInInfoModal" />
        <partial name="_IndexFooterModel" />
    </div>
</body>
</html>
